{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JgRs6eu4YUzwEVok4r4Xb3","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_18/projects/schema-dag-extraction/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# schema-dag-extraction — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 14:09 UTC | 更新原因: 80-rel FewRel 正式结果录入, Dream 失败后重启, 证据进展更新\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n验证 type confusability 独立于 type count 驱动 training-free LLM IE 质量下降，发现 multi-channel degradation model（count→recall, confusability→type confusion），并据此构建 SDGD 框架。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research 阶段** — MVP 已通过（D005）。核心证据链基本成型：\\\\n- Claim 1+2（confusability independence + multi-channel）：三任务验证完成（Few-NERD ✓, FewRel 80-rel ✓, MAVEN ✓），证据强\\\\n- Claim 3（SDGD）：SDGD-zero 负向（D014），v2 probe 进行中（D015）\\\\n- exp-012（多模型 LLaMA 验证）：cuda:0 运行中\\\\n- Dream full 模拟重启（dream_20260515T140829），等待回调\\\\n\\\\n## 核心证据进展\\\\n\\\\n**已完成（Claim 1+2 证据链）**:\\\\n- exp-001: count curve (recall 0.72→0.42, WrongType 0→2434) ✓\\\\n- exp-002: pairwise r=0.156 (p<1e-11), confusion ratio 10-28x ✓\\\\n- exp-003a: prompt v2 降低 over-prediction ✓\\\\n- exp-004: MAVEN 168 types, MiniLM pairwise r=0.120 ✓, centrality confound case study ✓\\\\n- exp_fewrel_formal: 16-rel sanity check, BCS Δ=-9.1pp ✓\\\\n- **exp_fewrel_formal_80rel**: 80-rel 正式实验, BCS Δ=-31.2pp, scaling 3.4x vs 16-rel ✓ ← 关键证据\\\\n- exp007_error_taxonomy: 错误分类机制验证 ✓\\\\n\\\\n**进行中**:\\\\n- exp-012 (LLaMA multi-model): cuda:0 运行中，P0\\\\n- SDGD v2 probe: 2h time-boxed (D015)\\\\n\\\\n**负向结论**:\\\\n- exp-008 SDGD-zero: F1 < single-pass，decomposition boosts recall but kills precision (D014)\\\\n- exp004_maven_bcs: per-type BCS 在 MAVEN 上正向（centrality confound）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] exp-012 LLaMA 多模型验证完成 → 录入 registry\\\\n- [ ] Dream 回调 → 分析审稿反馈 → 调整 plan\\\\n- [ ] SDGD v2 probe 结果 → 决定 Claim 3 方向（保留/改 analysis-only）\\\\n- [ ] 根据 Dream + exp-012 结果确定最终实验列表\\\\n- [ ] 启动论文写作（Paper Agent）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 服务器: cqa1-38874, 1× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell (98GB), cuda:0\\\\n- MVP + Research 已用: ~15h（估）\\\\n- 剩余 P0: exp-012 (~6h) + SDGD v2 probe (~2h)\\\\n- P1 候选: exp-005 (DocRED), exp-006 (interaction), exp-015 (SCS validation)\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\nEMNLP 2026, ARR May 25 提交（距今 10 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-15 | SDGD v2 time-boxed probe (2h) before multi-model;  | exp-008, exp-012 |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-15 | SDGD-zero 差于 baseline，Claim 3 需重大调整或放弃 | exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd |\\\\n| D013 | 2026-05-15 | Narrative 精化：核心论点从 embedding domain boundary 改为 pa | exp004_maven_bcs |\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-15 | 证据层级重排：pairwise SCS→confusion 为唯一主要证据，per-type 降为辅 | exp004_maven_bcs |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-15 | 采用 Narrative A: embedding proxy 有域边界，same-domain 需 | exp004_maven_bcs, fewrel_pilot, exp003a_prompt_v2_rerun |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-15 | FewRel pilot PASS (D007)，commit RE 为第三任务；需做 embedd | fewrel_pilot |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-15 | Paper story reframe: BCS proxy task-specific → SDG | exp004_maven_bcs, exp003a_prompt_v2_rerun |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-15 | 重构证据层级：pairwise 分析升为主要证据，batch-level 需控制 type freq | exp003a |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-15 | RE 第三任务需先做 BCS pilot 验证，不直接 commit | — |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-15 | 跳过 Dream 模拟，直接批准 P0 实验 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2800, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YQW7E4MCgex7BLGs95MZwY","session_id":"2bbd81e7-c592-4ad1-960d-e0f6cbc6cb78","uuid":"f6d69659-e35c-4549-9f4e-4f9591629eb3","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:45:27.465Z"}
