{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SRVXUXAnRADX6JPmU2x4Et","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_18/projects/schema-dag-extraction/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-15\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp012_llama_fewnerd_r2 | — | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp008_sdgd_v2_fewnerd（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp012_llama_fewnerd** (failed): —\\\\n- **exp007_error_taxonomy** (success): —\\\\n- **exp_fewrel_formal_80rel** (success): —\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 8 / 负向 2 / 失败 2 / 共 12\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ncqa1-38874: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp012_llama_fewnerd: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 544, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SXRss7eBGJPPmpwoPgRkvQ","session_id":"2bbd81e7-c592-4ad1-960d-e0f6cbc6cb78","uuid":"7c38c1ec-8f4f-44cc-a18c-53eb805a393e","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:45:47.775Z"}
