{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015gpvvgLkdzKfxyG3g6DPak","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_18/projects/schema-dag-extraction/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 16\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: 项目立项，MVP 验证方案：Experiment 2 (Confusability Controlled) 为核心验证实验\\\\n  rationale: 'IDEA_BRIEF 的核心假设是 type confusability 独立于 type count 驱动 LLM IE 质量下降。Experiment\\\\n    2（固定 count 变 BCS）是最直接的假设检验。Pass 标准: |r|≥0.3 且 p<0.05。ACE05 RE + Few-NERD 双数据集验证。ARR\\\\n    May 25 DDL（11天），MVP 需 1-2 天完成。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 MVP 统计设计：random samples 从 10 增至 25/档，加入 per-type solo baseline 控制变量，核心指标改为\\\\n    Δ(solo_F1 - batch_F1)\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 n=12 下 |r|=0.3 对应 p≈0.34，无法同时满足 |r|≥0.3 且 p<0.05。增至 25 random\\\\n    batches/档 → n≈54，|r|≥0.27 即可达 p<0.05。同时加入 solo F1 控制 type 固有难度，避免将\\\\\\\"类型本身难抽取\\\\\\\"误归因于\\\\\\\"confusability\\\\n    效应\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 分析方法从 Δ(solo-batch) 切换到 within-count Pearson r(F1, BCS)，pass 标准更新为\\\\n    |r|≥0.3 at fixed count\\\\n  rationale: Exp 1 发现 count curve 方向反转（F1 随 count 上升），根因是低 count 时模型过度 hallucinate（pred/gold=8x\\\\n    at count=1）。solo baseline 处于极端行为模式，Δ 被跨 count 行为差异污染。改为 within-count 对比更干净：同一\\\\n    count 下比较不同 BCS 的 F1，直接检验 confusability 独立效应。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp001_count_baseline\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: count curve reversed, hallucination at low count\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 主指标更新为 within-count r(recall, BCS)，F1 因 over-prediction confound 降为补充指标\\\\n  rationale: Exp 1 text-match 重评估发现：recall 单调下降（0.72→0.42，符合预期），precision 单调上升（0.11→0.52，over-prediction\\\\n    减少），F1 受 precision 主导而反转。within-count 分析中 precision confound 在同一 count 下近似恒定，F1\\\\n    仍可用；但 recall 更干净且直接反映 type confusion。WrongType 错误（text 正确但 type 错标）随 count 从 0\\\\n    升至 2434，直接支持 confusability 假设。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp001_count_baseline\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: recall monotonically decreases with count; WrongType errors increase;\\\\n      over-prediction confounds F1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 02:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP PASS（refined mechanism）: confusability 通过 type confusion 通道驱动降级，选择\\\\n    Narrative A (multi-channel degradation model)'\\\\n  rationale: Exp 2 结果：recall vs BCS 不显著（r=0.25, p=0.066），但 F1 vs BCS 在 count_12 显著（r=0.50,\\\\n    p=0.008），偏相关 r=0.30 p=0.026 达到 pass 标准。Confusion rate high-BCS vs low-BCS 差异 30-40x（p=0.043）。机制清晰：confusability\\\\n    不导致遗漏，而是导致错标。选 Narrative A（multi-channel）因为：(1) 用上所有数据（exp1 count→recall + exp2\\\\n    BCS→confusion）(2) 两个正交机制 story 更丰富 (3) SDGD 框架天然需要同时处理 count 和 confusability。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp001_count_baseline\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: count drives recall decline 0.72→0.42\\\\n  - exp_id: exp002_confusability_controlled\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: BCS drives type confusion 30-40x, F1 partial r=0.30 p=0.026\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: 跳过 Dream 模拟，直接批准 P0 实验\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream 模拟因基础设施 bug 崩溃（TypeError: _run_dream_pipeline() got unexpected\\\\n    keyword argument ''operational_chat_id''），P0 实验已被阻塞 9+ 小时。这是平台问题不是项目问题，不应阻塞研究进度。paper_framing.md\\\\n    和 experiment_plan.yaml 已完成，方向清晰，可直接推进。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 04:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: RE 第三任务需先做 BCS pilot 验证，不直接 commit\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 RE 的 confusability 机制与 NER/ED 可能不同——RE type confusion 取决于\\\\n    entity pair 语义角色而非 relation label embedding 相似度。如果 BCS 在 RE 上不 work，反而削弱 task-agnostic\\\\n    claim。策略：先花 1h 做 FewRel type 的 BCS 矩阵 + 小规模 pilot（5 batches），确认信号存在再 commit P0；信号不存在则\\\\n    claim 缩窄为 span-level IE，在 limitation 中承认。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 05:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: 重构证据层级：pairwise 分析升为主要证据，batch-level 需控制 type frequency\\\\n  rationale: exp003a v2 Reviewer 独立核实发现 within-count BCS-F1 正相关（高 BCS→高 F1），与假设方向相反。根因：type\\\\n    frequency 混淆变量（高频类型既有高 BCS 又被模型更好提取）。pairwise 分析（r=0.156, p=4.6e-12）不受此影响，仍成立。需要：(1)\\\\n    pairwise 升为 Channel 1 主要证据 (2) 新增 per-type F1 分析控制频率 (3) batch-level 正相关在论文中透明报告并解释混淆变量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp003a\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: within-count r>0 contradicts hypothesis direction\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Paper story reframe: BCS proxy task-specific → SDGD-cal empirical calibration\\\\n    成为核心贡献'\\\\n  rationale: MAVEN per-type 分析显示 BCS 与 F1 正相关（ρ=+0.184, p=0.025），与 Few-NERD 方向相反且已排除\\\\n    frequency confound。说明 embedding-based BCS 是 task-specific proxy：对 NER 有效（type\\\\n    name 相似度驱动 confusion），对 ED 无效（trigger word 歧义驱动 confusion，非 type name embedding\\\\n    距离）。Reframe 方向：BCS proxy 有局限 → 需要 empirical confusability（从 actual confusion matrix\\\\n    推导）→ SDGD-cal 用 empirical calibration 解决跨任务泛化。这让 SDGD-cal 成为比 SDGD-zero 更核心的贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp004_maven_bcs\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: MAVEN per-type ρ=+0.184 contradicts hypothesis\\\\n  - exp_id: exp003a_prompt_v2_rerun\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: Few-NERD per-type ρ=-0.293 supports hypothesis\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: FewRel pilot PASS (D007)，commit RE 为第三任务；需做 embedding ablation (MiniLM\\\\n    vs Qwen3 × 3 tasks)\\\\n  rationale: FewRel pilot 显示高 BCS→低 accuracy（Δ=-21~50pp），效应量极大，假设方向正确。但使用了 MiniLM（BCS\\\\n    range 0.42-0.97）而非 Qwen3（Few-NERD/MAVEN 用的）。三任务交叉对比显示：NER 弱负(Qwen3)、ED 反向(Qwen3)、RE\\\\n    强负(MiniLM)——无法区分 task effect vs embedding effect。需要 2×3 embedding ablation（MiniLM/Qwen3\\\\n    × NER/ED/RE）来厘清。这是 CPU 任务（重算 BCS 矩阵+重跑分析），成本极低但对论文 story 至关重要。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: fewrel_pilot\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: batch Δ=-21~50pp, hypothesis direction correct\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: '采用 Narrative A: embedding proxy 有域边界，same-domain 需 SDGD-cal empirical\\\\n    calibration'\\\\n  rationale: 三任务数据全用上：Few-NERD(NER)+FewRel(RE) 作为 cross-domain positive evidence，MAVEN(ED)\\\\n    作为 same-domain boundary condition。自然引出 SDGD-zero(embedding proxy, cross-domain)\\\\n    vs SDGD-cal(empirical confusion, task-agnostic) 的互补关系。比方案B（需先验证SDGD-cal）更安全，比方案C（浪费MAVEN数据）更坦诚。Claim\\\\n    1 修改为含 boundary condition 的版本。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp004_maven_bcs\\\\n    role: boundary_condition\\\\n    result: MAVEN per-type ρ=+0.184 positive\\\\n  - exp_id: fewrel_pilot\\\\n    role: cross_task_replication\\\\n    result: Δ=-21~50pp strong negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp003a_prompt_v2_rerun\\\\n    role: primary_evidence\\\\n    result: Few-NERD per-type ρ=-0.293\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 09:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 证据层级重排：pairwise SCS→confusion 为唯一主要证据，per-type 降为辅助（centrality confound）\\\\n  rationale: MAVEN MiniLM ablation 证实 per-type 正向与 embedding 选择无关（MiniLM ρ=+0.208,\\\\n    Qwen3 ρ=+0.184 方向一致）。但 MiniLM pairwise 在 MAVEN 上显著（r=+0.120, p≈0），Qwen3 无信号。说明：(1)\\\\n    pairwise confusability 在所有数据集上真实存在，(2) per-type mean BCS 混合了 confusability 和 type\\\\n    centrality（语义邻居多=常见类型=LLM 擅长=高 F1），频率控制无法完全消除。论文主要证据应聚焦 pairwise SCS→confusion\\\\n    + FewRel batch-level 强效应，per-type 作为辅助，MAVEN per-type 正向作为 centrality confound\\\\n    案例研究。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp004_maven_bcs\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: MiniLM pairwise r=+0.120 significant; per-type positive both embeddings\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 09:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: Narrative 精化：核心论点从 embedding domain boundary 改为 pairwise vs aggregation\\\\n    level confound\\\\n  rationale: MAVEN MiniLM ablation 证实 per-type 正向与 embedding 无关（MiniLM 无压缩也正向）。问题是\\\\n    per-type 聚合的 centrality confound，非 embedding proxy 失效。但 MiniLM pairwise 在 MAVEN\\\\n    上显著（r=+0.120）→ pairwise confusability 跨任务普遍存在。SDGD 直接用 pairwise similarity 做 graph\\\\n    coloring，绕过聚合 confound。论文核心论点：confusability 在 type-pair 级别操作，per-type aggregation\\\\n    在同域 schema 引入 centrality confound，SDGD 的 pairwise 设计天然规避此问题。2×3 embedding ablation\\\\n    矩阵本身成为论文 Table。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp004_maven_bcs\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: MiniLM pairwise r=+0.120 on MAVEN; per-type positive both embeddings\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: SDGD-zero 差于 baseline，Claim 3 需重大调整或放弃\\\\n  rationale: exp-008 SDGD-zero F1=0.251 < single_pass=0.445 < random_batch=0.320。根因：merge\\\\n    amplifies hallucination——每个 batch 处理全部样本但 schema 受限，模型过度预测 batch 内类型，merge 累积\\\\n    FP。confusability-aware 分解比随机分组差可能因为语义不相关 types 混合导致模型缺少 disambiguation context。Claims\\\\n    1-2（confusability 分析）不受影响。需要决定：(A) 修复 merge 策略重跑 (B) SDGD 降为 discussion/future\\\\n    work (C) 等 SDGD-cal 结果再定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp008_sdgd_zero_fewnerd\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: SDGD-zero F1=0.251 < single_pass=0.445\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: SDGD v2 time-boxed probe (2h) before multi-model; fail → Claim 3 降为 future\\\\n    work\\\\n  rationale: SDGD-zero 负向(F1=0.251 vs single_pass=0.445)，根因 merge amplification 已诊断。v2\\\\n    修复(min_batch_size+confidence-gated merge)成本仅2h，成功则论文获 prescriptive contribution，失败不伤\\\\n    Claims 1-2。距 DDL 10 天，串行 v2→exp-012 时间充裕。成功标准：v2 F1 > 0.445。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'negative: SDGD-zero F1=0.251, merge amplification confirmed'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-012\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: 'planned: multi-model validation after v2 probe'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 9147, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SXRss7eBGJPPmpwoPgRkvQ","session_id":"2bbd81e7-c592-4ad1-960d-e0f6cbc6cb78","uuid":"bb21b2fb-2e17-4c15-b5b6-4797dcca5a7e","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:46:03.488Z"}
